  "body": "Positioned on an elevated freehold site in a quiet Long Bay cul-de-sac, this brand-new architectural residence combines generous proportions, refined finishes and peaceful bush and sea outlooks for sophisticated family living and effortless entertaining. \r\n\r\nThe surrounding greenery is an integral part of the home’s appeal. Along one side, the bush outlook creates a living picture, bringing a sense of tranquillity into the interiors. Upstairs, the living area and master bedroom enjoy sea views, adding another dimension to this beautiful natural setting.\r\n\r\nDesigned for modern families, five bedrooms and five bathrooms are complemented by three generous living areas, offering excellent separation and space to come together or retreat. A high-end kitchen with premium-brand appliances forms the heart of the home, while easy-care outdoor spaces offer a relaxed, lock-and-leave lifestyle.\r\n\r\n• Five spacious bedrooms, each with its own ensuite\r\n• Designer kitchen with premium appliances and scullery, flowing to spacious living areas.\r\n• Multiple sun-soaked living areas capturing the sea views and park views\r\n• Seamless indoor-outdoor flow for effortless entertaining\r\n• Upstairs master enjoy private balconies and beautiful views\r\n•  Three spacious living areas, including an upstairs retreat\r\n• Peaceful bush outlook creating a beautiful green backdrop\r\n• Sea views from the upstairs living area and master bedroom\r\n• Easy-care outdoor spaces for relaxed living\r\n• Double internal-access garage plus two off-street parking spaces\r\n• Brand-new residence by an experienced, reputable developer\r\n• Premium Long Bay location, a minute’s walk to a scenic bush and sea-view walkway, close to the beach and village cafes and amenities.\r\n\r\nAlbany Mega Centre and Westfield Albany are around 10 minutes away by car, while Long Bay Town Centre and Regional Park are approx. a 10 minute walk. Pinehurst, Kristin and Massey University are around 15 minutes by car, with school bus access to Pinehurst and Kristin. Zoned for Long Bay School, Northcross Intermediate and Long Bay College, with easy motorway access to Auckland’s CBD.\r\n\r\nGenerous in scale and beautifully connected to its surroundings, this exceptional home presents an opportunity to enjoy contemporary luxury with nature as your everyday backdrop.",
